# Repo-wide backstop. Each sample also carries its own .gitignore; these
# patterns cover anything a build pulls down or produces, so a new sample is
# covered before it gets a file of its own.
#
# Rule of thumb: sources, layer definitions, and configuration are tracked.
# Anything a build downloads or emits is not — it is large, machine-specific,
# and reproducible from what is tracked.

# AI agent configuration (local only — never commit)
.claude
.claude/
.claude.md
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.MD
.cursorrules
.cursor/
.github/copilot*
.aider*
.continue/
.codeium/
.tabnine*
.sourcery.yaml

# --- Raspberry Pi / embedded Linux image output ---------------------------
# Flashable images run to multiple GB and rebuild from the tracked layers.
*.img
*.img.xz
*.img.gz
*.img.zip
*.img.bz2
*.img.zst
*.img.sha256
*.wic
*.wic.xz
*.iso
*.sdcard

# rpi-image-gen staging, output, and its own pinned checkout
**/image/work/
**/image/deploy/
**/rpi-image-gen/

# --- Build output ---------------------------------------------------------
build/
dist/
out/
_build/
target/debug/
target/release/
*.o
*.a
*.elf
*.uf2
*.dtbo

# ESP-IDF. sdkconfig is generated from the tracked sdkconfig.defaults.
sdkconfig
sdkconfig.old
dependencies.lock

# --- Dependencies pulled at build time -----------------------------------
node_modules/
managed_components/
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
vendor/

# --- Generated screen captures -------------------------------------------
# Throwaway captures the capture tooling re-emits on every run: the numbered
# iteration shots, the test-session sequence, and the live-preview scratch
# file. Screenshots a README or doc page actually embeds stay tracked.
**/shots/dev/
**/shots/sess-*.png
**/shots/live.png
**/shots/root.png
**/shots/out.png
**/screenshots/dev/

# --- Pulled off a device, not authored -----------------------------------
# Stock-firmware dumps taken before reflashing, and live-mount snapshots.
**/firmware/backup/
**/firmware/circuitpy/

# --- Local bench configuration -------------------------------------------
# Holds the address of whichever board you are working against. See the
# matching dev.env.example in each sample.
**/scripts/dev.env

# --- Editors / OS --------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
*.log

# Large CAD source — distributed out-of-band
TorsionTableCAD/lr4_table_clean.FCStd
TorsionTableCAD/TorsionTable.zip
